GEMM raised-GPU publication commands (2026-09-08)

All compilation and linking ran on the x86 host. The Jetson AGX Orin only
executed the cross-compiled AArch64 binaries.

1. Export semantic matched objects

POLYGEIST_MINIMAL_CUDA_RUNTIME=1 \
POLYGEIST_EXPORT_OBJECT_DIR=/tmp/polybench-publication-orin/gemm/raised-paper-export \
POLYGEIST_SKIP_LINK=1 \
scripts/correctness/polygeist_build.sh --target=jetson \
  --semantic-mlir=issues/polybench_section42/ir/gemm/raised_gpu/matched.mlir \
  --harness=issues/polybench_section42/logs/publication_orin/gemm/raised_harness.c \
  -o /tmp/polybench-publication-orin/gemm/unused \
  tools/cgeist/Test/polybench/linear-algebra/blas/gemm/gemm.c \
  -O3 -Itools/cgeist/Test/polybench/utilities \
  -Itools/cgeist/Test/polybench/linear-algebra/blas/gemm \
  -DLARGE_DATASET -DDATA_TYPE_IS_DOUBLE -DPOLYBENCH_USE_C99_PROTO

2. Link correctness executable with the x86-host cross-builder

POLYGEIST_GPU_RESIDUAL_FUNCTION=kernel_gemm \
POLYGEIST_GPU_DATA_RESIDENCY_FUNCTION=kernel_gemm \
POLYGEIST_GPU_DATA_RESIDENCY_ASSUME_NO_ALIAS=1 \
POLYGEIST_GPU_REGION_TIMING=1 \
POLYGEIST_GPU_REGION_TIMING_FUNCTION=kernel_gemm \
POLYGEIST_GPU_ARCH=sm_87 \
POLYGEIST_BUILD_WORK_DIR=/tmp/polybench-publication-orin/gemm/raised-paper-correctness-work \
HARNESS_CFLAGS='-O3 -DCORRECTNESS_RUN' \
scripts/correctness/build_jetson.sh \
  /tmp/polybench-publication-orin/gemm/raised-paper-export/abi.mlir \
  /tmp/polybench-publication-orin/gemm/raised-paper-correctness \
  /tmp/polybench-publication-orin/gemm/raised-paper-export/wrapper.o \
  issues/polybench_section42/logs/publication_orin/gemm/raised_harness.c

3. Execute correctness on Orin

POLYGEIST_SILICON_PROFILE=pva-general \
scripts/correctness/run_jetson.sh --exe \
  /tmp/polybench-publication-orin/gemm/raised-paper-correctness \
  publication_gemm_raised_paper_correctness

4. Link timing executable with the x86-host cross-builder

POLYGEIST_GPU_RESIDUAL_FUNCTION=kernel_gemm \
POLYGEIST_GPU_DATA_RESIDENCY_FUNCTION=kernel_gemm \
POLYGEIST_GPU_DATA_RESIDENCY_ASSUME_NO_ALIAS=1 \
POLYGEIST_GPU_REGION_TIMING=1 \
POLYGEIST_GPU_REGION_TIMING_FUNCTION=kernel_gemm \
POLYGEIST_GPU_ARCH=sm_87 \
POLYGEIST_BUILD_WORK_DIR=/tmp/polybench-publication-orin/gemm/raised-paper-timing-work \
HARNESS_CFLAGS='-O3' \
scripts/correctness/build_jetson.sh \
  /tmp/polybench-publication-orin/gemm/raised-paper-export/abi.mlir \
  /tmp/polybench-publication-orin/gemm/raised-paper-timing \
  /tmp/polybench-publication-orin/gemm/raised-paper-export/wrapper.o \
  issues/polybench_section42/logs/publication_orin/gemm/raised_harness.c

5. Execute one-process five-warmup/five-sample timing on Orin

POLYGEIST_SILICON_PROFILE=pva-general \
scripts/correctness/run_jetson.sh --exe \
  /tmp/polybench-publication-orin/gemm/raised-paper-timing \
  publication_gemm_raised_paper_timing_5x5
